      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 3.84,
          "en": "Enough about loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.84,
          "end": 6.87,
          "en": "we're loading all the data we need for this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.87,
          "end": 9.66,
          "en": "all expenses and single expenses here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.66,
          "end": 13.23,
          "en": "And then for now it's time to work on updating and deleting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.23,
          "end": 15.75,
          "en": "So when we load an expense here to well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.75,
          "end": 18.09,
          "en": "View the expense details and I edit it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 21.45,
          "en": "If I Click Save, I don't wanna create a new expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.45,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "which is what would currently happen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 25.71,
          "en": "instead, I wanna update the existing expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.71,
          "end": 27.36,
          "en": "And of course, I also wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.36,
          "end": 30.42,
          "en": "that clicking this Delete button does something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.42,
          "end": 32.643,
          "en": "And we'll start with updating here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.54,
          "end": 34.92,
          "en": "For that, I'll actually start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.92,
          "end": 37.62,
          "en": "by going back to expenses.server.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.62,
          "end": 41.16,
          "en": "So this utility file, if you want to call it like that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.16,
          "end": 45.54,
          "en": "that contains all my expense database related logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.54,
          "end": 47.13,
          "en": "And there I'll export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.13,
          "end": 50.61,
          "en": "a new async function called updateExpense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.61,
          "end": 52.26,
          "en": "And here I expect to get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.26,
          "end": 54.75,
          "en": "the idea of the expense that should be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.75,
          "end": 59.28,
          "en": "and also the expenseData that should be used for updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.28,
          "end": 61.413,
          "en": "So the updated data, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.37,
          "end": 64.89,
          "en": "And then in there we again will use prisma",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.89,
          "end": 66.6,
          "en": "and reach out to expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.6,
          "end": 69.81,
          "en": "And then there is an update method provided by prisma",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.81,
          "end": 73.65,
          "en": "which well, allows us to do what the name suggests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.65,
          "end": 76.83,
          "en": "We have to pass a configuration object to update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 79.71000000000001,
          "en": "and this object takes a wear property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.71000000000001,
          "end": 81.72,
          "en": "which we could have also used for filtering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.72,
          "end": 84.69,
          "en": "and which we did use here for getting a single expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.69,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "But here we simply define which expense should be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 90.09,
          "en": "or which expense says.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.09,
          "end": 92.03999999999999,
          "en": "And here I'm looking for an expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.03999999999999,
          "end": 94.95,
          "en": "where the idea is equal to the idea I'm getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.95,
          "end": 96.42,
          "en": "Again, using that shortcut",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.42,
          "end": 99.93,
          "en": "which I already talked about here for get expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.93,
          "end": 101.34,
          "en": "So this makes sure that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.34,
          "end": 104.55,
          "en": "the one expense that has this id will be updated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.55,
          "end": 106.62,
          "en": "And besides this where configuration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.62,
          "end": 110.07,
          "en": "we then also have to provide the data configuration here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.07,
          "end": 112.89,
          "en": "to this overall configuration object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.89,
          "end": 116.7,
          "en": "And here we define which fields should be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.7,
          "end": 119.49000000000001,
          "en": "and what the new values should be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 119.49000000000001,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "and here we can simply copy the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 124.11,
          "en": "from creating an expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.11,
          "end": 125.73,
          "en": "So this code which we assigned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.73,
          "end": 129.69,
          "en": "to data as a value there as well, I'll just copy that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.69,
          "end": 132.99,
          "en": "and use data as a value for data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 132.99,
          "end": 135.63,
          "en": "So we assign the updated title, amount and date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.63,
          "end": 137.85,
          "en": "converted to the respective types,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 137.85,
          "end": 140.493,
          "en": "to that expense with that id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.07999999999998,
          "end": 143.55,
          "en": "So this is all the code we need,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.55,
          "end": 146.52,
          "en": "this will update the data in the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 146.52,
          "end": 150.24,
          "en": "Prisma will again create the actual query for us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 150.24,
          "end": 151.8,
          "en": "and execute it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 151.8,
          "end": 154.5,
          "en": "And we can of course wrap this with try-catch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 154.5,
          "end": 158.97,
          "en": "so that we can later add more meaningful error handling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 158.97,
          "end": 162.153,
          "en": "At the moment, I'll just again catch and lock the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 163.32,
          "end": 165.57,
          "en": "And with that we can call update expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 165.57,
          "end": 169.95,
          "en": "But the question is where do we call updateExpense?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 169.95,
          "end": 173.07,
          "en": "This updateExpense function should be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 173.07,
          "end": 176.25,
          "en": "whenever we submit this form in Edit mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.25,
          "end": 178.89,
          "en": "so from that detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 178.89,
          "end": 181.59,
          "en": "Therefore it's actually an action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 181.59,
          "end": 184.893,
          "en": "on this $id route that should be triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.15,
          "end": 188.97,
          "en": "There we don't have a loader, but I now wanna have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.97,
          "end": 191.46,
          "en": "an action function that will be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 195.87,
          "en": "whenever a non GET request is sent to this route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195.87,
          "end": 198.153,
          "en": "And I'll turn it into an async function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 199.32,
          "end": 201.39,
          "en": "And here I also extract the paramas",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 201.39,
          "end": 204.72,
          "en": "because this is on a route with a dynamic parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 204.72,
          "end": 207.87,
          "en": "and I will need that dynamic parameter to find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.87,
          "end": 211.35,
          "en": "which expense with which ID should be updated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.35,
          "end": 214.05,
          "en": "And then here in this action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.05,
          "end": 218.25,
          "en": "I will get my expenseId by accessing params.id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.25,
          "end": 220.95,
          "en": "again using that name that's included in the file name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.95,
          "end": 225.18,
          "en": "to get the actual id that's encoded in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 225.18,
          "end": 227.57999999999998,
          "en": "And then I of course also need to get the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.57999999999998,
          "end": 229.74,
          "en": "that was entered into the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 229.74,
          "end": 231.78,
          "en": "for that we can use this request object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 231.78,
          "end": 234.81,
          "en": "which we also get by Remix in this overall object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 234.81,
          "end": 237.12,
          "en": "passed to the action function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 237.12,
          "end": 240.21,
          "en": "And on that object we can call form data again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 240.21,
          "end": 243.33,
          "en": "just as we did it for creating an expense because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 243.33,
          "end": 245.78,
          "en": "technically here there isn't really a difference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 246.87,
          "end": 249.3,
          "en": "So here I get my form data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 249.3,
          "end": 253.623,
          "en": "by awaiting for request.formData as a method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 254.79,
          "end": 257.67,
          "en": "And then we can get our expenseData here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 257.67,
          "end": 262.05,
          "en": "by using object.fromentries and passing formData to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 262.05,
          "end": 264.36,
          "en": "And that's basically the same code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 264.36,
          "end": 267.99,
          "en": "we had here in add.jsx, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 267.99,
          "end": 271.2,
          "en": "That's how we extract the form data here in the action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 271.2,
          "end": 275.1,
          "en": "and that's the same way we're doing it here in this action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 275.1,
          "end": 277.05,
          "en": "With that, we got all the data we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 277.05,
          "end": 279.65999999999997,
          "en": "for this updateExpense function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 279.65999999999997,
          "end": 281.7,
          "en": "which needs the id and the expense data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 281.7,
          "end": 284.01,
          "en": "which is precisely what we have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 284.01,
          "end": 288.6,
          "en": "So we can call updateExpense and of course import it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 288.6,
          "end": 290.883,
          "en": "from this expenses.server file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 291.81,
          "end": 295.5,
          "en": "And then here pass the expenseId as a first argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.5,
          "end": 298.71,
          "en": "and the expenseData as a second argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 298.71,
          "end": 302.47,
          "en": "And then we can await this and then return a redirect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 303.36,
          "end": 306,
          "en": "with that redirect utility function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306,
          "end": 308.763,
          "en": "which is imported from remix-run/node.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.87,
          "end": 314.82,
          "en": "And here I simply wanna redirect to /expenses again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 314.82,
          "end": 318.18,
          "en": "we were on ('/expenses/') sumId",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.18,
          "end": 320.88,
          "en": "and now I want to go back to that list of expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 320.88,
          "end": 323.76,
          "en": "after updating that single expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 323.76,
          "end": 325.23,
          "en": "So that's the logic here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 325.23,
          "end": 328.14,
          "en": "of course here we also might want to add validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 328.14,
          "end": 330.45,
          "en": "just as we have it in the add action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 330.45,
          "end": 333.12,
          "en": "So therefore we can copy the code from there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 333.12,
          "end": 337.59000000000003,
          "en": "and also add this in this action here to validate the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 337.59000000000003,
          "end": 340.65,
          "en": "with that validateExpenseInput function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 340.65,
          "end": 344.43,
          "en": "which also must be imported into this $.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 344.43,
          "end": 346.743,
          "en": "from the validation.server file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 348.15,
          "end": 350.1,
          "en": "And with that, we ensure that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 350.1,
          "end": 351.87,
          "en": "also when updating our data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 351.87,
          "end": 355.83,
          "en": "we validated before we reach out to the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 355.83,
          "end": 359.04,
          "en": "So the action is similar to the add action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 359.04,
          "end": 361.02,
          "en": "but it does something different,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 361.02,
          "end": 364.8,
          "en": "it updates an expense instead of adding one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 364.8,
          "end": 367.23,
          "en": "But it works with the same form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 367.23,
          "end": 371.4,
          "en": "and therefore of course, we have generally the same logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 371.4,
          "end": 374.94,
          "en": "We will also be able to benefit from the use navigation hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 374.94,
          "end": 378,
          "en": "for showing to the user that something's happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 378,
          "end": 379.17,
          "en": "behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 379.17,
          "end": 381.81,
          "en": "because we're still triggering an action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 381.81,
          "end": 384.48,
          "en": "and therefore this navigation property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 384.48,
          "end": 386.16,
          "en": "gives us access to the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 386.16,
          "end": 388.86,
          "en": "and we'll be able to show a different button caption",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 388.86,
          "end": 391.35,
          "en": "whilst the request is on its way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 391.35,
          "end": 395.73,
          "en": "So we have that shared logic with different actions here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
